<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka avg lending rate rises to 14.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka avg lending rate rises to 14.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average prime lending rate of Sri Lanka's commercial banks rose to 14.4 percent in the week ending August 15 from 13.1 percent in the week before, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in its weekly economic report that the average rate a year ago was 18.5 percent.</p>
</text>
